# Colección de requests para la extensión REST Client de VS Code (humao.rest-client).
# Con la API levantada (`npm run dev`) y la base cargada con database.sql.
# Datos del seed: usuario 1 tiene órdenes; instrumento 47 (acción con precio), 54 (acción con
# precio), 66 (ARS, moneda); orden 5 es una LIMIT en estado NEW; orden 2 está FILLED.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@userId = 1

### ------------------------------------------------------------------ Portfolio

### Portfolio del usuario 1: pesos disponibles/reservados, valor total y posiciones
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/{{userId}}/portfolio

### Usuario inexistente -> 404 NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/999/portfolio

### userId inválido -> 400 VALIDATION_FAILED
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/abc/portfolio

### ------------------------------------------------------------------ Búsqueda de activos

### Por ticker (sin distinguir mayúsculas)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/instruments?q=pam

### Por nombre
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/instruments?q=pampa

### Paginada por cursor: copiá `page.nextCursor` de la respuesta en el parámetro `cursor`
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/instruments?q=s&limit=5

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/instruments?q=s&limit=5&cursor=PEGAR_NEXT_CURSOR_ACA

### Sin coincidencias -> data: []
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/instruments?q=zzzz

### q vacío -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/instruments?q=

### ------------------------------------------------------------------ Enviar órdenes
# Cada envío necesita su propio Idempotency-Key. Repetir EXACTAMENTE el mismo request con la
# misma clave devuelve la orden original (200) en vez de crear otra.

### MARKET por cantidad -> 201 FILLED al último cierre
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-market-qty-0001

{
  "userId": 1,
  "instrumentId": 47,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "quantity": 10,
  "currency": "ARS"
}

### El mismo envío repetido (misma clave) -> 200 con la misma orden
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-market-qty-0001

{
  "userId": 1,
  "instrumentId": 47,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "quantity": 10,
  "currency": "ARS"
}

### La misma clave con otro body -> 422 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-market-qty-0001

{
  "userId": 1,
  "instrumentId": 47,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "quantity": 11,
  "currency": "ARS"
}

### LIMIT por monto en pesos -> 201 NEW, quantity = floor(5000 / 900) = 5
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-limit-amount-0001

{
  "userId": 1,
  "instrumentId": 47,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "LIMIT",
  "amount": "5000.00",
  "price": "900.00",
  "currency": "ARS"
}

### MARKET por monto -> cantidad máxima de acciones enteras al último cierre
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-market-amount-0001

{
  "userId": 1,
  "instrumentId": 54,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "amount": "2000.00",
  "currency": "ARS"
}

### Venta MARKET dentro de la tenencia (el usuario 1 tiene 500 del instrumento 54) -> FILLED
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-sell-ok-0001

{
  "userId": 1,
  "instrumentId": 54,
  "side": "SELL",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "quantity": 100,
  "currency": "ARS"
}

### Venta por encima de la tenencia -> 201 REJECTED (se registra, no cambia saldos)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-sell-rejected-0001

{
  "userId": 1,
  "instrumentId": 54,
  "side": "SELL",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "quantity": 100000,
  "currency": "ARS"
}

### Compra por encima de los pesos disponibles -> 201 REJECTED
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-buy-rejected-0001

{
  "userId": 1,
  "instrumentId": 47,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "quantity": 10000,
  "currency": "ARS"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------ Pedidos inválidos (no se registran)

### LIMIT sin price -> 400 VALIDATION_FAILED
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-invalid-limit-0001

{
  "userId": 1,
  "instrumentId": 47,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "LIMIT",
  "quantity": 1,
  "currency": "ARS"
}

### quantity y amount juntos -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-invalid-both-0001

{
  "userId": 1,
  "instrumentId": 47,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "quantity": 1,
  "amount": "1000.00",
  "currency": "ARS"
}

### Sin currency -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-invalid-currency-0001

{
  "userId": 1,
  "instrumentId": 47,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "quantity": 1
}

### Monto que no alcanza para una acción -> 422 ZERO_QUANTITY
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-zero-qty-0001

{
  "userId": 1,
  "instrumentId": 47,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "amount": "100.00",
  "currency": "ARS"
}

### Instrumento de tipo MONEDA (66 = ARS) -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-invalid-currency-instr-0001

{
  "userId": 1,
  "instrumentId": 66,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "quantity": 1,
  "currency": "ARS"
}

### Sin el header Idempotency-Key -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "instrumentId": 47,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "quantity": 1,
  "currency": "ARS"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------ Cancelar una orden

### Cancelar la orden 5 (LIMIT en estado NEW) del usuario 1 -> 200 CANCELLED
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/orders/5/cancellation
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1 }

### Repetir la cancelación -> 409 ORDER_NOT_CANCELLABLE
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/orders/5/cancellation
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1 }

### Cancelar una orden FILLED (la 2) -> 409 ORDER_NOT_CANCELLABLE
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/orders/2/cancellation
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1 }

### Cancelar la orden de otro usuario -> 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/orders/5/cancellation
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 2 }

### ------------------------------------------------------------------ Operación

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness (base de datos accesible)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Documentación interactiva: {{baseUrl}}/docs/   |   OpenAPI: {{baseUrl}}/docs-json
GET {{baseUrl}}/docs-json
